### ============================================================
### NEXUS RESILIENCE STUDIO - Kich ban kiem thu bang IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Khoi dong: user-service(8081) -> order-service(8082) -> api-gateway(8080)
### Moi request di qua gateway (8080); "chaos" goi thang user-service (8081) de pha.
### ============================================================

### 0. RESET: user-service khoe lai + CB ve CLOSED (chay truoc moi kich ban)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos/reset

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/reset

### Xem trang thai CB / Bulkhead bat cu luc nao
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/status


### ============================================================
### KICH BAN 1 - TIMEOUT (user-service cham 4s, TimeLimiter cat o 1.5s)
### ============================================================
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos?delayMs=4000

###
# Ky vong: ~1500ms, outcome=TIMEOUT, HTTP 504
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/timeout/1


### ============================================================
### KICH BAN 2 - RETRY (2 lan dau loi, lan 3 thanh cong)
### ============================================================
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos/reset

###
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos?failFirstN=2

###
# Ky vong: OK, attempts=3, ~1500ms (cho 500ms + 1000ms backoff). Xem log order-service: [RETRY ...]
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/retry/1

###
# Biendoi: loi 5 lan > 3 lan thu -> that bai HTTP 502 sau 3 lan goi
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos?failFirstN=5

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/retry/1


### ============================================================
### KICH BAN 3 - BULKHEAD (toi da 3 request dong thoi)
### ============================================================
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos/reset

###
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos?delayMs=2000

###
# Ban 10 request song song. Ky vong: 3 x OK, 7 x BULKHEAD_FULL (bi tu choi ngay, khong cho)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/burst/bulkhead?n=10


### ============================================================
### KICH BAN 4 - CIRCUIT BREAKER (user-service sap)
### ============================================================
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos/reset

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/reset

###
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos?failPercent=100

### Goi 5 lan dau -> UPSTREAM_5XX (CB dang dem). Bam Send nhieu lan:
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/circuit-breaker/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/circuit-breaker/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/circuit-breaker/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/circuit-breaker/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/circuit-breaker/1

### Lan thu 6: CIRCUIT_OPEN, HTTP 503, tra ve ngay (~0ms), user-service KHONG bi goi
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/circuit-breaker/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/status

### Cho 10s (CB sang HALF_OPEN), cho user-service khoe lai:
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos/reset

### Goi 2 lan thanh cong -> CB ve CLOSED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/circuit-breaker/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/circuit-breaker/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/status


### ============================================================
### KICH BAN 5 - KET HOP CA 4: Retry( CB( Timeout( Bulkhead ))) + Fallback
### ============================================================

### 5a. Binh thuong
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos/reset

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/reset

###
# Ky vong: OK, attempts=1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/combined/1

### 5b. Loi thoang qua -> Retry cuu duoc
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos?failFirstN=2

###
# Ky vong: OK, attempts=3
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/combined/1

### 5c. Cham -> Timeout moi lan -> Retry 3 lan -> CB dem loi
### (reset CB truoc de cua so dem sach, ket qua de du doan)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/reset

###
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos?delayMs=4000

###
# Ky vong: ~6s, FALLBACK (vi TIMEOUT), attempts=3, HTTP 200 + user du phong
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/combined/1

###
# Lan 2: 3 loi o lan 1 + 2 loi dau lan 2 = 5 loi -> CB OPEN giua chung. Retry KHONG thu lai khi mach mo.
# Ky vong: FALLBACK (vi CIRCUIT_OPEN), attempts=2, ~2.5s
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/combined/1

###
# Lan 3: mach dang OPEN. Ky vong: FALLBACK (vi CIRCUIT_OPEN), attempts=0, ~0ms (fail-fast)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/combined/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/status

### 5d. Tat fallback de thay loi that
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/combined/1?fallback=false

### 5e. Qua tai: 20 request song song (user-service cham 4s). Suc chua bulkhead = 3 thread + 2 hang doi = 5
### Ky vong: phan lon BULKHEAD_FULL (tu choi ngay), vai request TIMEOUT / CIRCUIT_OPEN; order-service khong bi treo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/reset

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/burst/combined-nofallback?n=20

### 5f. Hoi phuc: user-service khoe, doi 10s, CB HALF_OPEN -> CLOSED
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos/reset

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/combined/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/resilience/status


### ============================================================
### ENDPOINT GOC CUA CODE MAU (Feign "xxx": readTimeout 3s + Retryer.Default 3 lan)
### De thay hanh vi goc: chaos?delayMs=4000 roi goi -> Feign timeout, tu retry 3 lan
### ============================================================
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos?delayMs=4000

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

###
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chaos/reset
